  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The bond order of $\\mathrm{N}_2, \\mathrm{O}_2$, and $\\mathrm{O}_2^{-}$are respectively 3,2 and $1.5$\nSince higher bond order implies higher bond dissociation energy hence the correct order will be\n$$\n\\mathrm{N}_2>\\mathrm{O}_2>\\mathrm{O}_2^{-}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
